WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.822
Methodology and transparency.

00:00:02.772 --> 00:00:05.056
How TENET5 was built.

00:00:05.056 --> 00:00:11.568
This page provides complete transparency about how two hundred and sixty-four investigation pages were constructed.

00:00:11.568 --> 00:00:16.227
Every data source, every tool, every process is documented here.

00:00:16.227 --> 00:00:23.193
TENET5 is built on three principles: official sources only, no anonymous claims, and independent verifiability.

00:00:23.193 --> 00:00:25.670
Every page cites its sources.

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.874
Every figure can be checked against the official record.

00:00:28.874 --> 00:00:32.284
The entire codebase is open source on GitHub.

00:00:32.284 --> 00:00:38.386
We document the documentation because transparency about the process is part of the investigation itself.
